{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53811","headline":"赠隐士 · 白居易","name":"赠隐士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御风烟眇（一作「渺」）多无伴，入鸟差池不乱羣。\n（同上《隐逸部·隐士》）（按：以上所据《千载佳句》，系据日本东京大学藏森鸥外所赠抄本。\n此本系由王水照教授影印携归。\n此本有校录异文。\n《文史》二十三辑刊严绍荡同志《日本〈千载佳句〉白居易诗佚句辑稿》，系据金子彦二郎校本，今亦据以参校。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}